791
00:40:22,222 --> 00:40:25,403
[SPEAKER_02]: So we came back here to Columbus to play there, and I was out to O'Neill Park.

792
00:40:26,664 --> 00:40:28,705
[SPEAKER_02]: And I struck out nine straight times.

793
00:40:29,925 --> 00:40:31,866
[SPEAKER_02]: And I could see the ball, you know, as it got right there.

794
00:40:32,466 --> 00:40:35,967
[SPEAKER_02]: And I wasn't that bad of a hitter, if I have to say it myself.

795
00:40:36,467 --> 00:40:36,948
