796
00:40:37,028 --> 00:40:38,708
[SPEAKER_02]: I struck out nine times in a row.

797
00:40:39,509 --> 00:40:45,711
[SPEAKER_02]: So Mike Kelly said to me, he said, uh, Nick, he said, uh, can you see that ball?

798
00:40:45,751 --> 00:40:46,411
