[SPEAKER_02]: He said, you might get hurt again.

803
00:40:52,197 --> 00:40:59,022
[SPEAKER_02]: So he took me out and we went back home then, went back to Minneapolis and we played Toledo again and Rosie Ryan was pitching.

804
00:40:59,943 --> 00:41:02,785
