[SPEAKER_02]: I said, well, it's a long curveball, that's a sink.

806
00:41:06,467 --> 00:41:08,609
[SPEAKER_02]: So he threw one up there and I hit it out of the park.

807
00:41:09,950 --> 00:41:10,530
[SPEAKER_02]: And it's hittin'.

808
00:41:11,411 --> 00:41:13,913
[SPEAKER_02]: And I played from then on the rest of the year.

809
00:41:15,319 --> 00:41:17,360
[SPEAKER_01]: Well, your vision straightened out then, huh?

810
